{
    "name": "apiverve/objectdetector",
    "description": "Object Detector finds the objects in an image, from people, cars and traffic lights to dogs, laptops and cups, and returns each one's label, a numeric confidence and its bounding box in pixels and as fractions of the image, plus a count per label. Filter by minimum confidence or by the labels you care about.",
    "version": "1.2.6",
